# The rows of src/runtime/recipes/vulpen/library/parts/picture/Picture.cpp, a call each (src/tools/bench/bench.py).

## Picture.cpp/Picture::bind
[("file", "/p/a.png"), ("mip_levels", "all")] -> ["texture picture of u8vec4", "file /p/a.png"]
[("file", "/p/a.png"), ("mip_levels", "none")] -> throws runtime_error: "mip_levels = none is no count of levels, nor all"; asked []
[("mip_levels", "1")] -> ["texture picture of u8vec4"]

## Picture.cpp/Picture::cook
a file not there -> uploads []; logged ["error: <here>/gone.png is empty, or not there"]
a.png's version as before -> uploads []; logged []
a.png's version moved -> uploads ["image 0 2x1, 4294967295 levels, 8 bytes #8869e677"]; logged []
a.png, every level -> uploads ["image 0 2x1, 4294967295 levels, 8 bytes #8869e677"]; logged []
b.png, no picture -> uploads []; logged ["error: <here>/b.png is no image stb_image reads: unknown image type"]
no file -> uploads []; logged []

## Picture.cpp/mip_levels
("") -> throws runtime_error: "mip_levels =  is no count of levels, nor all"
("-1") -> throws runtime_error: "mip_levels = -1 is no count of levels, nor all"
("0") -> throws runtime_error: "mip_levels = 0 is no count of levels, nor all"
("1") -> 1
("12") -> 12
("1x") -> throws runtime_error: "mip_levels = 1x is no count of levels, nor all"
("4294967295") -> 4294967295
("4294967296") -> throws runtime_error: "mip_levels = 4294967296 is no count of levels, nor all"
("All") -> throws runtime_error: "mip_levels = All is no count of levels, nor all"
("all") -> 4294967295
("x") -> throws runtime_error: "mip_levels = x is no count of levels, nor all"
